    <h2>4. Your visual checklist</h2>
    <ul class="check">
        <li><strong>Look / branding</strong> — logo, colors, fonts; first viewport must still read as ePartsCart / EcomAE.</li>
        <li><strong>Graphics &amp; 3D / motion</strong> — storefront piston/parts motion; CP/ERP/BOS login particles, rings, logo animation.</li>
        <li><strong>Functionality</strong> — after ASP.NET is primary, open PHP reference URLs to verify nothing was missed.</li>
        <li><strong>Gap workflow</strong> — note mismatches on /migration/compare → fix ASP.NET → re-run dual-sample vs PHP reference.</li>
        <li><strong>Evidence</strong> — <code>docs/migration/evidence/presentation/live-super-cp-tenant-probe.json</code> and <code>docs/migration/PHP_AS_REFERENCE_MODE.md</code>.</li>
